      "description": "## Customer\n\nThis folder contains all API endpoints for managing **customer** records within the Laravel CRUD API.\n\nIt exposes a complete set of RESTful operations:\n\n| Request | Description |\n|---------|-------------|\n| **CREATE** | Add a new customer record to the system |\n| **GET ALL** | Retrieve a list of all existing customers |\n| **SEARCH** | Query or filter customers by specific criteria |\n| **UPDATE** | Modify the details of an existing customer |\n| **DELETE** | Permanently remove a customer record |\n\nUse these endpoints to create, read, search, update, and delete customer profiles as part of the broader Laravel application backend."
