      "description": "## Item\n\nThis folder contains all API endpoints for managing **item** records within the Laravel CRUD API.\n\nIt exposes a complete set of RESTful operations:\n\n| Request | Description |\n|---------|-------------|\n| **CREATE** | Add a new item to the catalog |\n| **GET ALL** | Retrieve a list of all existing items |\n| **SEARCH** | Query or filter items by specific criteria |\n| **UPDATE** | Modify the details of an existing item |\n| **DELETE** | Permanently remove an item from the catalog |\n\nUse these endpoints to create, read, search, update, and delete catalog items as part of the broader Laravel application backend."
