      "description": "## Order\n\nThis folder contains all API endpoints for managing **order** records within the Laravel CRUD API.\n\nIt exposes a complete set of RESTful operations:\n\n| Request | Description |\n|---------|-------------|\n| **CREATE** | Place a new order linking a customer to one or more items |\n| **GET ALL** | Retrieve a list of all existing orders |\n| **SEARCH** | Query or filter orders by specific criteria |\n| **UPDATE** | Modify the details of an existing order |\n| **DELETE** | Permanently remove an order record |\n\nUse these endpoints to create, read, search, update, and delete orders as part of the broader Laravel application backend."
